  \"kind\": \"cron\"\n      },\n      \"sessionTarget\": \"isolated\",\n      \"wakeMode\": \"now\",\n      \"payload\": {\n        \"kind\": \"agentTurn\",\n        \"message\": \"Run a full backup to the openclaw-backup repo: 1) Copy all critical files from ~/.openclaw to workspace-backup (excluding secrets - use placeholders for tokens/keys). 2) Commit with date. 3) Push to https://github.com/TeraHertz2000/openclaw-backup. 4) After success, send a message to Discord channel 1481072502724759602 using the message tool with action=send, channel=discord, message=\\\"✅ Backup complete - [summary of what was backed up]\\\". Use model=minimax-portal/MiniMax-M2.1. Report the results here.\"\n      },\n      \"delivery\": {\n        \"mode\": \"none\",\n        \"channel\": \"discord\",\n        \"to\": \"channel:1481072502724759602\"\n      },\n      \"state\": {\n        \"nextRunAtMs\": 1773549000000,\n        \"lastRunAtMs\": 1773462600006,\n        \"lastStatus\": \"ok\",\n        \"lastDurationMs\": 202950,\n        \"consecutiveErrors\": 0,\n        \"lastRunStatus\": \"ok\",\n        \"lastDelivered\": false,\n        \"lastDeliveryStatus\": \"not-delivered\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"e1b719dc-47fb-45f7-b4b2-c36742813ce6\",\n      \"agentId\": \"main\",\n      \"name\": \"vault-sync\",\n      \"enabled\": true,\n      \"createdAtMs\": 1772399848448,\n      \"updatedAtMs\": 1773468219934,\n      \"schedule\": {\n        \"expr\": \"0 */6 * * *\",\n        \"kind\": \"cron\",\n        \"staggerMs\": 300000\n      },\n      \"sessionTarget\": \"isolated\",\n      \"wakeMode\": \"now\",\n      \"payload\": {\n        \"kind\": \"agentTurn\",\n        \"message\": \"Sync the Obsidian vault: 1) cd ~/obsidian-vault && git add -A 2) If there are changes, commit with message including current timestamp (format: \\\"Vault auto-save $(date +'%Y-%m-%d %H:%M')\\\") 3) git push to https://github.com/TeraHertz2000/tera-vault. Report only if there were changes and the push succeeded.\"\n      },\n      \"delivery\": {\n        \"channel\": \"discord\",\n        \"to\": \"1481072502724759602\",\n        \"mode\": \"announce\"\n      },\n      \"state\": {\n        \"nextRunAtMs\": 1773489806432,\n        \"lastRunAtMs\": 1773468206441,\n        \"lastStatus\": \"ok\",\n        \"lastDurationMs\": 13493,\n        \"consecutiveErrors\": 0,\n        \"lastRunStatus\": \"ok\",\n        \"lastDeliveryStatus\": \"delivered\",\n        \"lastDelivered\": true\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"0bd24b87-4e9d-4cf4-8005-b21e45f87aca\",\n      \"agentId\": \"main\",\n      \"name\": \"conversation-review\",\n      \"enabled\": true,\n      \"createdAtMs\": 1772402146774,\n      \"updatedAtMs\": 1773385349947,\n      \"schedule\": {\n        \"expr\": \"0 3 * * *\",\n        \"tz\": \"America/New_York\",\n        \"kind\": \"cron\"\n      },\n      \"sessionTarget\": \"isolated\",\n      \"wakeMode\": \"now\",\n      \"payload\": {\n        \"kind\": \"agentTurn\",\n        \"message\": \"You are a memory consolidation agent. Your job is to review today's conversations and extract important information worth saving.\\n\\n## Your Task\\n\\n1. First, read the session history to find all conversations from today (2026-03-01). Look in:\\n   - Discord channels (check message history)\\n   - Any TUI sessions\\n\\n2. Extract anything worth remembering:\\n   - Decisions made\\n   - Preferences stated\\n   - Facts about Noah\\n   - Tasks completed or assigned\\n   - Plans discussed\\n   - Ideas generated\\n   - Anything explicitly asked to remember\\n   - Anything important that should be saved\\n\\n3. For each item extracted:\\n   - Check if it already exists in ~/workspace/MEMORY.md or ~/workspace/memory/2026-03-01.md\\n   - If new, write durable facts to ~/workspace/MEMORY.md\\n   - Write daily context to ~/workspace/memory/2026-03-01.md\\n   - File relevant content to appropriate ~/obsidian-vault/ folder:\\n     - Fitness/health → projects/personal-trainer/\\n     - Food/recipes → projects/personal-chef/\\n     - Productivity/time-blocking → projects/time-blocking/\\n     - Research/links → references/\\n     - Daily logs → daily/2026-03-01.md\\n   - Use clear filenames (e.g., \\\"leg-day-routine.md\\\", not \\\"notes.md\\\")\\n   - Do NOT duplicate - update existing entries if something changed\\n\\n4. After writing everything, git commit and push the obsidian vault:\\n   ```bash\\n   cd ~/obsidian-vault\\n   git add -A\\n   git commit -m \\\"Memory update: $(date +%Y-%m-%d)\\\"\\n   git push\\n   ```\\n\\n5. Post a summary to the channel you were triggered from (or #general-chat if unknown). Format:\\n   - \\\"📝 Saved X new items to memory\\\"\\n   - \\\"📂 Updated Y vault files\\\"\\n   - List each item on one line\\n   - If nothing worth saving, post \\\"nothing new today\\\"\\n\\n## Important\\n- Be thorough - check ALL channels\\n- Don't fabricate entries - only save real information\\n- Before writing, check if info already exists\\n- Update existing files rather than creating duplicates\"\n      },\n      \"delivery\": {\n        \"channel\": \"discord\",\n        \"mode\": \"announce\",\n        \"to\": \"1477760568533323918\"\n      },\n      \"state\": {\n        \"nextRunAtMs\": 1773471600000,\n        \"lastRunAtMs\": 1773385200009,\n        \"lastStatus\": \"ok\",\n        \"lastDurationMs\": 149938,\n        \"consecutiveErrors\": 0,\n        \"lastRunStatus\": \"ok\",\n        \"lastDeliveryStatus\": \"delivered\",\n        \"lastDelivered\": true,\n        \"runningAtMs\": 1773471600006\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":14,"aggregated":"{\n  \"version\": 1,\n  \"jobs\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"8e183fd9-a9ab-4e36-9433-bc077c8e87fd\",\n      \"agentId\": \"main\",\n      \"name\": \"auto-update\",\n      \"enabled\": true,\n      \"createdAtMs\": 1772397868623,\n      \"updatedAtMs\": 1773288144564,\n      \"schedule\": {\n        \